function PerformancePanel({hub}:{hub:Hub}){const {t}=useInventoryLanguage(),[period,setPeriod]=useState('month'),[date,setDate]=useState(day());const start=period==='day'?date:period==='week'?new Date(new Date(date+'T00:00:00Z').getTime()-6*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10):date.slice(0,8)+'01';const docs=hub.documents.filter(d=>!d.voided_at&&d.date>=start&&d.date<=date),bills=docs.filter(d=>d.kind==='bill'),returns=docs.filter(d=>d.kind==='return'),sales=bills.reduce((n,d)=>n+d.total,0),loss=returns.reduce((n,d)=>n+d.body.loss,0),profit=bills.reduce((n,d)=>n+d.body.lines.reduce((m,l)=>m+l.quantity*l.profit,0),0)-loss;const people=hub.employees.map(e=>({employee:e,bills:bills.filter(d=>d.actor_id===e.user_id),leads:hub.leads.filter(l=>l.created_by===e.user_id)}));return <><section><h2>{t('Daily, weekly & monthly P&L')}</h2><div className="prod-fields"><label>{t('Period')}<select value={period} onChange={e=>setPeriod(e.target.value)}><option value="day">Daily</option><option value="week">Weekly</option><option value="month">Monthly</option></select></label><label>{t('Through date')}<input type="date" value={date} max={day()} onChange={e=>setDate(e.target.value)}/></label></div><div className="prod-metrics office-metrics"><section><span>{t('Sales')}</span><strong>{rupees(sales)}</strong></section><section><span>{t('Estimated gross profit')}</span><strong>{rupees(profit+loss)}</strong></section><section><span>{t('Return loss on sale value')}</span><strong>{rupees(loss)}</strong></section><section><span>{t('Estimated P&L')}</span><strong>{rupees(profit)}</strong></section></div></section><section><h2>{t('Employee performance')}</h2><div className="office-list">{people.map(({employee,bills,leads})=><div key={employee.id}><strong>{employee.name} · {employee.employee_code}</strong><span>{t('Leads')}: {leads.length} · {t('Verified')}: {leads.filter(l=>l.verified_at).length} · {t('Sales')}: {rupees(bills.reduce((n,b)=>n+b.total,0))}</span></div>)}</div></section></>}
function IncentivePanel({hub}:{hub:Hub}){const {t}=useInventoryLanguage(),[period,setPeriod]=useState('month'),[date,setDate]=useState(day());const start=period==='day'?date:period==='week'?new Date(new Date(date+'T00:00:00Z').getTime()-6*864e5).toISOString().slice(0,10):date.slice(0,8)+'01';const rows=hub.employees.map(e=>({employee:e,rewards:hub.incentives.filter(r=>r.employee===e.id&&r.date>=start&&r.date<=date),target:hub.targets.filter(r=>r.employee===e.id).at(-1)}));return <section><h2>{t('Incentive & targets')}</h2><div className="prod-fields"><label>{t('Period')}<select value={period} onChange={e=>setPeriod(e.target.value)}><option value="day">Daily</option><option value="week">Weekly</option><option value="month">Monthly</option></select></label><label>{t('Through date')}<input type="date" value={date} max={day()} onChange={e=>setDate(e.target.value)}/></label></div><div className="office-list">{rows.map(({employee,rewards,target})=><div key={employee.id}><strong>{employee.name} · {employee.employee_code} · {rupees(rewards.reduce((n,r)=>n+r.amount,0))}</strong><span>{t('Conversion')}: {target?.conversionRate||0}% / {employee.conversion_target}% · {t('Retention')}: {target?.retentionRate||0}% / {employee.retention_target}%</span>{target?.penaltyPercent?<span>{t('Target penalty')}: {target.penaltyPercent}%</span>:null}{target?.ownerReview&&<strong className="prod-error">{t('Owner review required')}</strong>}</div>)}</div></section>}
function StatementPanel({hub}:{hub:Hub}){const {t}=useInventoryLanguage(),[customer,setCustomer]=useState(''),[from,setFrom]=useState(''),[to,setTo]=useState(day());const rows=[...hub.documents.filter(d=>!d.voided_at).map(d=>({id:d.id,customer:d.customer,date:d.date,label:`${d.number} · ${d.kind}`,amount:d.total-d.paid})),...hub.moneyRows.map(m=>({id:m.id,customer:m.customer,date:m.date,label:m.kind==='opening'?'Opening due':m.kind,amount:m.amount}))].filter(r=>(!customer||r.customer===customer)&&r.date<=to).sort((a,b)=>a.date.localeCompare(b.date)||a.id.localeCompare(b.id));const opening=rows.filter(r=>from&&r.date<from).reduce((n,r)=>n+r.amount,0),visible=rows.filter(r=>!from||r.date>=from);let running=opening;return <section className="office-statement"><h2>{t('Customer statement')}</h2><div className="prod-fields office-no-print"><label>{t('Customer')}<select value={customer} onChange={e=>setCustomer(e.target.value)}><option value="">{t('All customers')}</option>{hub.leads.map(l=><option key={l.id} value={l.id}>{l.name} · {l.phone}</option>)}</select></label><label>{t('From')}<input type="date" value={from} onChange={e=>setFrom(e.target.value)}/></label><label>{t('To')}<input type="date" value={to} onChange={e=>setTo(e.target.value)}/></label></div><button className="office-no-print" onClick={()=>window.print()}>{t('Print / Save PDF')}</button><p>{t('Opening balance')}: {rupees(opening)}</p><div className="prod-report-table"><table><thead><tr><th>{t('Date')}</th><th>{t('Customer')}</th><th>{t('Entry')}</th><th>{t('Due added / paid')}</th><th>{t('Running balance')}</th></tr></thead><tbody>{visible.map(r=>{running+=r.amount;return <tr key={r.id}><td>{r.date}</td><td>{hub.leads.find(l=>l.id===r.customer)?.name}</td><td>{r.label}</td><td>{rupees(r.amount)}</td><td>{rupees(running)}</td></tr>})}</tbody></table></div><strong>{t('Closing due / advance')}: {rupees(running)}</strong></section>}
